{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Two geese. One fragile egg. Infinite chaos.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together to carry it through unpredictable challenges without breaking it, every crack makes it harder, every mistake more hilarious. A co-op physics game about teamwork, clumsiness, and the unstoppable power of honking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112070/extras/25f8488ba1db8fda3581de9730ee6462.poster.avif?t=1769348502\" width=612 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112070/extras/25f8488ba1db8fda3581de9730ee6462.webm?t=1769348502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112070/extras/25f8488ba1db8fda3581de9730ee6462.mp4?t=1769348502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cracks = Chaos</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With every <strong>crack</strong>, the egg becomes <strong>harder</strong> to control and easier to lose. Each impact makes it wobblier, bouncier, and far more unpredictable. Handle it carefully, or watch it explode <strong>in a glorious mess</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112070/extras/a029842a9c62890dd96fd457cfd41056.poster.avif?t=1769348502\" width=612 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112070/extras/a029842a9c62890dd96fd457cfd41056.webm?t=1769348502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112070/extras/a029842a9c62890dd96fd457cfd41056.mp4?t=1769348502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Not all is lost</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the egg <strong>slips away</strong>, you can still <strong>recover</strong> it. Every fall is a chance to try again. Fragile, cracked, but never truly broken.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112070/extras/796ebde78b87f7e830e7683ad9957c33.poster.avif?t=1769348502\" width=612 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112070/extras/796ebde78b87f7e830e7683ad9957c33.webm?t=1769348502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112070/extras/796ebde78b87f7e830e7683ad9957c33.mp4?t=1769348502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Teamwork at its finest</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick up your useless partner, throw them back on track, and pretend you didn\u2019t almost drop them on purpose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112070/extras/d68652ecb41ed239f2e41291a1ca0d94.poster.avif?t=1769348502\" width=612 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112070/extras/d68652ecb41ed239f2e41291a1ca0d94.webm?t=1769348502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112070/extras/d68652ecb41ed239f2e41291a1ca0d94.mp4?t=1769348502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One egg, endless chaos</strong> \u2013 Keep it safe (or try) through unpredictable physics and tricky obstacles.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cracks that change everything</strong> \u2013 Each hit makes the egg weaker and the game harder.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Teamwork and betrayal</strong> \u2013 Lift, toss, honk, and sometimes sabotage your partner.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-fueled fun</strong> \u2013 Clumsy controls and goose energy combine for hilarious moments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A true test of patience</strong> \u2013 Rage, laugh, and celebrate every inch of progress.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4112070?t=1769348502","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112070/d8dceac24e5428b5be6991bf685e394b3bf41a7b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769348502","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112070/4cd9fd2593bc211f70cd85198e3cb82247972709/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769348502","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112070/4cd9fd2593bc211f70cd85198e3cb82247972709/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769348502","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4154710,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Two geese. One fragile egg. Infinite chaos.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together to carry it through unpredictable challenges without breaking it, every crack makes it harder, every mistake more hilarious. A co-op physics game about teamwork, clumsiness, and the unstoppable power of honking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112070/extras/25f8488ba1db8fda3581de9730ee6462.poster.avif?t=1769348502\" width=612 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112070/extras/25f8488ba1db8fda3581de9730ee6462.webm?t=1769348502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112070/extras/25f8488ba1db8fda3581de9730ee6462.mp4?t=1769348502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cracks = Chaos</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With every <strong>crack</strong>, the egg becomes <strong>harder</strong> to control and easier to lose. Each impact makes it wobblier, bouncier, and far more unpredictable. Handle it carefully, or watch it explode <strong>in a glorious mess</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112070/extras/a029842a9c62890dd96fd457cfd41056.poster.avif?t=1769348502\" width=612 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112070/extras/a029842a9c62890dd96fd457cfd41056.webm?t=1769348502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112070/extras/a029842a9c62890dd96fd457cfd41056.mp4?t=1769348502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Not all is lost</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the egg <strong>slips away</strong>, you can still <strong>recover</strong> it. Every fall is a chance to try again. Fragile, cracked, but never truly broken.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112070/extras/796ebde78b87f7e830e7683ad9957c33.poster.avif?t=1769348502\" width=612 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112070/extras/796ebde78b87f7e830e7683ad9957c33.webm?t=1769348502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112070/extras/796ebde78b87f7e830e7683ad9957c33.mp4?t=1769348502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Teamwork at its finest</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick up your useless partner, throw them back on track, and pretend you didn\u2019t almost drop them on purpose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112070/extras/d68652ecb41ed239f2e41291a1ca0d94.poster.avif?t=1769348502\" width=612 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112070/extras/d68652ecb41ed239f2e41291a1ca0d94.webm?t=1769348502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112070/extras/d68652ecb41ed239f2e41291a1ca0d94.mp4?t=1769348502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One egg, endless chaos</strong> \u2013 Keep it safe (or try) through unpredictable physics and tricky obstacles.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cracks that change everything</strong> \u2013 Each hit makes the egg weaker and the game harder.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Teamwork and betrayal</strong> \u2013 Lift, toss, honk, and sometimes sabotage your partner.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-fueled fun</strong> \u2013 Clumsy controls and goose energy combine for hilarious moments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A true test of patience</strong> \u2013 Rage, laugh, and celebrate every inch of progress.</p></li></ul>","developers":["BBear Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112070/af1b508f0fea8862f209b5636d34902b049e6252/header.jpg?t=1769348502","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4112070/2143338501/93817e5fe50c8bb03cbf3db39281e5308839b49a/1769347932/dash_av1.mpd?t=1769348501","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4112070/2143338501/93817e5fe50c8bb03cbf3db39281e5308839b49a/1769347932/dash_h264.mpd?t=1769348501","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4112070/2143338501/93817e5fe50c8bb03cbf3db39281e5308839b49a/1769347932/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1769348501","id":257272450,"name":"Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257272450/c493831b056921dba166cdba7a8ccea7d1c9fbc0/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1769348501"}],"name":"An Eggstremely Hard Game","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 8/10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong>  NVIDIA GeForce GTX 460<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong>  Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</str